subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Analyze subscriptions and suggest cost optimizations

USAGE:
  subtrack optimize <OPTIONS>

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                               Display this help message
  -v, --version                            Display this version
  -j, --json                               Output as JSON
  --min-savings <min-savings>              Minimum yearly savings to show (default: 0)
  -c, --currency <currency>                Convert all prices to target currency
  --discount-rate <discount-rate>          Assumed yearly discount rate for annual plans in % (default: 15)
  --exclude <exclude>                      Comma-separated subscription names to exclude from analysis

